  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Tax Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the Global Tax Program is to strengthen tax systems of developing countries by facilitating the design and implementation of evidence-based tax systems. Intermediate objectives are greater participation of developing countries in the development of global tax systems, improved understanding of the requirements to improve the performance of country based tax institutions, and strengthening the application of research and knowledge development for improved performance

Country specific engagement: Somalia, Ethiopia, Niger, Nigeria, Cameroon, Chad, Uzbekistan, Azerbaijan,Tajikistan, Kyrgyzstan and other countries.</narrative>
  </description>
